{"seq":3,"slug":"canary-ab-deployment","title":"金丝雀与 A/B 部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/canary-ab-deployment","wordCount":1338,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"金丝雀与-a-b-部署策略\">金丝雀与 A/B 部署策略</h1><p>模型上线不是一个&quot;按钮&quot;——它是一个需要精心编排的渐进过程。与代码部署不同，模型的行为是概率性的：即使离线验证指标优秀，真实流量中的数据分布、用户行为和边界 case 都可能暴露意想不到的问题。金丝雀发布和 A/B 测试是将风险控制在可接受范围内的核心手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型部署的根本挑战是：<strong>如何在不确定性中做出安全的上线决策。</strong> 离线指标只是必要条件，不是充分条件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[新模型就绪] --&gt; B[影子模式]&#10;    B --&gt; C{输出一致?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[排查问题]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[金丝雀 1%]&#10;    E --&gt; F{核心指标稳定?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[自动回滚]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[放量 10%]&#10;    H --&gt; I{统计显著?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[继续观察]&#10;    I --&gt;|是| K[放量 50%]&#10;    K --&gt; L[全量切换]\">graph LR\n    A[新模型就绪] --&gt; B[影子模式]\n    B --&gt; C{输出一致?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[排查问题]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[金丝雀 1%]\n    E --&gt; F{核心指标稳定?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[自动回滚]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[放量 10%]\n    H --&gt; I{统计显著?}\n    I --&gt;|否| J[继续观察]\n    I --&gt;|是| K[放量 50%]\n    K --&gt; L[全量切换]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署策略</th>\n<th>流量分配</th>\n<th>决策依据</th>\n<th>风险暴露</th>\n<th>回滚速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>影子模式</td>\n<td>100% 复制但不生效</td>\n<td>输出对比</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>无需回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金丝雀</td>\n<td>1% → 5% → 20% → 100%</td>\n<td>实时监控指标</td>\n<td>低（按比例）</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A/B 测试</td>\n<td>50/50 随机分流</td>\n<td>统计检验</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝绿</td>\n<td>瞬间全量切换</td>\n<td>预验证</td>\n<td>高（全量暴露）</td>\n<td>秒级（切回旧环境）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多臂老虎机</td>\n<td>动态调整分配比例</td>\n<td>累积奖励最大化</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"金丝雀发布实践\">金丝雀发布实践</h2><p>金丝雀发布的核心逻辑是：<strong>用最小的流量验证新模型，逐步扩大暴露范围，任何异常立即回滚。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>KServe 金丝雀配置示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: serving.kserve.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: InferenceService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: fraud-detector&#10;spec:&#10;  predictor:&#10;    canaryTrafficPercent: 10&#10;    model:&#10;      modelFormat:&#10;        name: pytorch&#10;      storageUri: &#39;s3://models/fraud/v4&#39;&#10;  # 生产版本自动保留 90% 流量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">serving.kserve.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">InferenceService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fraud-detector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  predictor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    canaryTrafficPercent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      modelFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pytorch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      storageUri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'s3://models/fraud/v4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 生产版本自动保留 90% 流量</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>金丝雀指标监控体系：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控层</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>阈值示例</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统健康</td>\n<td>错误率、延迟 P99</td>\n<td>错误率 &gt; 0.1% 或延迟 &gt; 2x</td>\n<td>立即回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型质量</td>\n<td>预测分布、置信度</td>\n<td>分布偏移 &gt; 2σ</td>\n<td>暂停放量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务指标</td>\n<td>CTR、转化率、GMV</td>\n<td>下降 &gt; 1% 且显著</td>\n<td>回滚 + 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全指标</td>\n<td>违规输出率</td>\n<td>任何增长</td>\n<td>立即回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自动放量策略：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>traffic</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>traffic</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if all metrics pass for </mtext><mi>T</mi><mtext> minutes</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if any critical metric breached</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mtext>traffic</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>if metrics borderline (hold)</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{traffic}_{t+1} = \\begin{cases} 2 \\times \\text{traffic}_t &amp; \\text{if all metrics pass for } T \\text{ minutes} \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{if any critical metric breached} \\\\ \\text{traffic}_t &amp; \\text{if metrics borderline (hold)} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if all metrics pass for </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> minutes</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if any critical metric breached</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if metrics borderline (hold)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 通常设为 15-30 分钟，确保有足够的请求量产生统计可靠的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-b-测试框架\">A/B 测试框架</h2><p>A/B 测试在模型发布中的角色与金丝雀不同——它不是为了&quot;安全上线&quot;，而是为了<strong>用统计证据证明新模型确实更好</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>设计要素：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>分流策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户级分流（推荐）：同一用户始终看到同一版本，避免体验不一致</li>\n<li>请求级分流：每次请求独立分配，适合无状态的批量预测</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>样本量计算</strong>：</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\frac{(z_{\\alpha/2} + z_\\beta)^2 \\cdot 2\\sigma^2}{\\delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是期望检测的最小效应量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是指标方差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是 I 类和 II 类错误率。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><p><strong>多重检验校正</strong>：当同时监控多个指标时，需要对 p 值做 Bonferroni 或 FDR 校正，避免假阳性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>实验终止条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>达到预设样本量且结果显著 → 采纳</li>\n<li>达到预设样本量但结果不显著 → 保守保留旧版</li>\n<li>出现严重负面影响 → 提前终止</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"影子模式-shadow-deployment\">影子模式（Shadow Deployment）</h2><p>影子模式是风险最低的验证方式——新模型接收真实流量的副本，执行推理，但结果不返回给用户。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次将新类型的模型推向生产</li>\n<li>模型架构发生重大变化</li>\n<li>延迟敏感场景中验证新模型性能</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实现架构：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[负载均衡]&#10;    B --&gt; C[生产模型]&#10;    B --&gt;|复制请求| D[影子模型]&#10;    C --&gt; E[返回用户]&#10;    D --&gt; F[记录输出]&#10;    F --&gt; G[对比分析]&#10;    G --&gt; H{差异可接受?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[进入金丝雀]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[迭代模型]\">graph TD\n    A[用户请求] --&gt; B[负载均衡]\n    B --&gt; C[生产模型]\n    B --&gt;|复制请求| D[影子模型]\n    C --&gt; E[返回用户]\n    D --&gt; F[记录输出]\n    F --&gt; G[对比分析]\n    G --&gt; H{差异可接受?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[进入金丝雀]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[迭代模型]</pre><p><strong>对比分析维度：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输出一致性：新旧模型对同一请求的输出差异度</li>\n<li>延迟对比：新模型的 P50/P95/P99 延迟表现</li>\n<li>资源消耗：GPU 利用率、内存占用差异</li>\n<li>边界 case：异常输入下的行为差异</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自动回滚机制\">自动回滚机制</h2><p>自动回滚是金丝雀发布的安全网——当监控指标超过阈值时，系统无需人工干预即刻恢复到上一个稳定版本。</p>\n<p><strong>设计要点：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>多信号决策</strong>：不要依赖单一指标，至少组合错误率 + 延迟 + 一个业务指标</li>\n<li><strong>冷却期</strong>：回滚后设置冷却期（如 1 小时），避免自动系统反复尝试</li>\n<li><strong>回滚通知</strong>：所有自动回滚必须触发告警，人工介入分析根因</li>\n<li><strong>版本锁定</strong>：回滚后锁定版本，防止 CI/CD 自动重新部署有问题的版本</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"多臂老虎机-bandit-策略\">多臂老虎机（Bandit）策略</h2><p>当有多个候选模型时，传统 A/B 需要等待实验结束才能做决策。多臂老虎机（如 Thompson Sampling / UCB）可以<strong>在实验过程中动态调整流量分配</strong>，将更多流量导向表现好的模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定分流 A/B</td>\n<td>统计严谨</td>\n<td>探索期间浪费流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epsilon-Greedy</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>探索效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCB</td>\n<td>理论最优</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Thompson Sampling</td>\n<td>贝叶斯自然</td>\n<td>需要先验假设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>模型上线是渐进过程：影子 → 金丝雀 → A/B → 全量</li>\n<li>金丝雀以实时监控为决策依据，A/B 以统计检验为决策依据</li>\n<li>自动回滚是金丝雀的安全网，需要多信号组合决策</li>\n<li>多臂老虎机适合多模型同时竞争的场景</li>\n<li>所有策略都需要可靠的监控基础设施作为前提</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../data-drift-model-monitoring/practice/alerting-thresholds\">数据漂移与监控：告警阈值</a> — 告警阈值的设计方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/serving-and-inference/model-serving-patterns\">AI 基础设施：模型服务模式</a> — 服务模式的基础架构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"金丝雀与 A/B 部署策略","id":"金丝雀与-a-b-部署策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"金丝雀发布实践","id":"金丝雀发布实践"},{"level":2,"text":"A/B 测试框架","id":"a-b-测试框架"},{"level":2,"text":"影子模式（Shadow Deployment）","id":"影子模式-shadow-deployment"},{"level":2,"text":"自动回滚机制","id":"自动回滚机制"},{"level":2,"text":"多臂老虎机（Bandit）策略","id":"多臂老虎机-bandit-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"推理优化与加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/inference-optimization"},"next":{"title":"企业内部 ML 平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/platform/internal-ml-platform"}}